WEBVTT

00:00:52.952 --> 00:00:55.478
Arusu, who has the
True Book of Spells...

00:00:55.588 --> 00:00:59.582
...in order for others to believe in
humans and to save Atelia's life...

00:00:59.692 --> 00:01:03.424
...headed towards
Wizard Kingdom with Lennon.

00:01:04.664 --> 00:01:09.329
On the way, they were helped by Wil
and finally reached their destination.

00:01:10.103 --> 00:01:13.232
But the deal between
Grande didn't go well...

00:01:13.540 --> 00:01:17.033
...and they were surrounded
by the warlock police.

00:02:46.666 --> 00:02:50.125
Tweeny Witches

00:02:54.674 --> 00:02:59.134
Collapse

00:03:02.081 --> 00:03:05.107
Let me have the True Book of Spells!

00:03:05.552 --> 00:03:06.348
You!

00:03:06.886 --> 00:03:08.615
He's Grande?

00:03:09.088 --> 00:03:12.251
He led the rationalization
among warlocks...

00:03:12.392 --> 00:03:15.794
...for the use of machines
instead of magic.

00:03:16.296 --> 00:03:17.627
So what?

00:03:17.797 --> 00:03:19.287
What did you say?

00:03:19.966 --> 00:03:21.593
Wil, Lennon.

00:03:21.701 --> 00:03:24.432
I think I'll hand them
the True Book of Spells.

00:03:24.537 --> 00:03:25.470
Hey!

00:03:27.674 --> 00:03:29.574
Don't give it to them, Arusu!

00:03:31.811 --> 00:03:34.371
They're just taking
advantage of our weakness.

00:03:34.480 --> 00:03:36.642
They'll take everything away from us!

00:03:36.749 --> 00:03:40.379
You can't save your dad
or Atelia by doing this!

00:03:40.720 --> 00:03:42.950
Don't get in our way! Get them!

00:03:46.826 --> 00:03:48.521
Don't let them fool you!

00:03:48.628 --> 00:03:50.858
You can't forget about your objective!

00:03:50.930 --> 00:03:55.094
To prevent the use of dark magic...
That's all we need to do!

00:03:55.368 --> 00:03:56.494
| know that!

00:03:56.603 --> 00:03:59.300
But I'm going to keep my promise.

00:03:59.405 --> 00:04:01.464
Humans don't betray others.

00:04:01.574 --> 00:04:04.600
| want the people of this realm
to believe in humans.

00:04:04.677 --> 00:04:07.669
You will keep your promise, right?
Since you're the leader of this army.

00:04:07.747 --> 00:04:10.717
You're definitely going
to free Atelia, right?

00:04:10.817 --> 00:04:13.047
You don't trust us?

00:04:15.154 --> 00:04:18.351
This is the only thing
| can do for this realm.

00:04:18.691 --> 00:04:21.251
Only a human like myself can do this!

00:04:21.894 --> 00:04:22.918
Don't worry.

00:04:23.129 --> 00:04:27.362
Even if we don't have this, we can
defeat dark magic with the magic of light.

00:04:27.533 --> 00:04:28.110
Arusu!

00:04:28.134 --> 00:04:28.444
Arusu!
As long as you believe with all your heart...

00:04:28.468 --> 00:04:28.911
As long as you believe with all your heart...

00:04:28.935 --> 00:04:29.993
Arusu!
As long as you believe with all your heart...

00:04:30.103 --> 00:04:32.936
...anyone can use magic. Right, Dad?

00:04:42.048 --> 00:04:42.879
Luca!

00:04:43.716 --> 00:04:44.979
What is it?

00:04:45.084 --> 00:04:47.451
| have a message from Grande.

00:04:47.553 --> 00:04:49.282
Jidan has escaped.

00:04:49.355 --> 00:04:50.117
What?

00:04:50.623 --> 00:04:54.821
He said to bring the woman in his place.

00:04:55.662 --> 00:04:56.458
Fine.

00:04:56.863 --> 00:04:58.524
Take her down!

00:05:05.038 --> 00:05:07.439
Hey! Take her down for now!

00:05:07.674 --> 00:05:09.802
We're heading to Grande's place.

00:05:09.909 --> 00:05:12.935
Hold it right there!
Who do you think you are?

00:05:16.182 --> 00:05:17.707
What's your unit?

00:05:27.327 --> 00:05:27.919
Ji.

00:05:28.127 --> 00:05:29.356
Jidan!

00:05:30.697 --> 00:05:31.823
Why you!

00:05:33.232 --> 00:05:35.667
After them! Don't let them get away!

00:05:42.575 --> 00:05:43.565
What?

00:05:44.210 --> 00:05:46.804
We did what you asked. Move!

00:05:47.280 --> 00:05:49.908
| have to go find my dad.

00:05:50.016 --> 00:05:54.385
Plus I need to hurry up and head over
to where you guys are keeping Atelia.

00:05:54.487 --> 00:05:57.718
| won't be keeping my promise
if I don't save her.

00:05:57.824 --> 00:06:00.850
You thought we would
let you leave here alive?

00:06:00.960 --> 00:06:04.954
I still do. A journey's where
you buy souvenirs and head home...

00:06:05.064 --> 00:06:07.328
...to the ones you care about.

00:06:07.633 --> 00:06:08.862
Souvenirs?

00:06:13.005 --> 00:06:14.200
What is going on?

00:06:14.273 --> 00:06:16.901
A wizard rebellion, Grande.

00:06:17.143 --> 00:06:18.008
What?

00:06:18.277 --> 00:06:20.974
| gave you the
True Book of Spells like I promised.

00:06:21.080 --> 00:06:23.515
But I won't let you use dark magic.

00:06:23.616 --> 00:06:26.517
And since we came all this way...

00:06:26.619 --> 00:06:32.524
| thought maybe we could have
all the fairies you collected so far.

00:06:32.925 --> 00:06:34.359
You bastards!

00:06:34.694 --> 00:06:36.025
Crush them!

00:06:48.975 --> 00:06:50.101
Don't move!

00:06:50.743 --> 00:06:53.303
Try laying even a finger
on Arusu and the others!

00:06:53.413 --> 00:06:57.111
I'll use my super lightning spell
to end Grande's life!

00:06:57.483 --> 00:06:59.577
What are you people standing there for?

00:06:59.652 --> 00:07:02.451
The fairies are in the holding cells
in the basement. Go!

00:07:02.522 --> 00:07:03.318
Wil!

00:07:03.756 --> 00:07:05.952
You gave us one last chance!

00:07:06.025 --> 00:07:07.959
The wizards are going to win!

00:07:08.294 --> 00:07:09.125
Arusu!

00:07:10.763 --> 00:07:11.924
All right!

00:07:23.943 --> 00:07:25.308
Come back here!

00:07:35.988 --> 00:07:37.149
Why you!

00:07:43.529 --> 00:07:45.554
You two came for us!

00:07:45.665 --> 00:07:48.293
All the fairies in the
holding facility were stolen.

00:07:48.401 --> 00:07:48.959
What?

00:07:49.702 --> 00:07:52.535
Since you gave away the
True Book of Spells, the fairies here...

00:07:52.638 --> 00:07:54.163
...are our last hope!

00:07:54.974 --> 00:07:57.102
Arusu went to Wizard Kingdom?

00:07:57.210 --> 00:07:58.336
I'm sorry.

00:07:58.978 --> 00:08:02.676
| can't believe this. I escaped in
order to prevent that from happening.

00:08:02.849 --> 00:08:04.374
Lennon is with her too.

00:08:04.484 --> 00:08:05.474
Lennon too?

00:08:05.551 --> 00:08:08.680
They tried to help us.

00:08:09.789 --> 00:08:11.314
It's all my fault...

00:08:11.491 --> 00:08:13.289
| don't know what to say.

00:08:14.026 --> 00:08:15.994
I should be the one to apologize.

00:08:17.463 --> 00:08:18.692
Back then, I...

00:08:19.799 --> 00:08:23.702
Where's Lennon? Where's Jidan?
| came since I heard they were here.

00:08:24.437 --> 00:08:27.566
If I hadn't taken Lennon and
vanished from your sight...

00:08:27.673 --> 00:08:30.438
...it wouldn't have
turned out like this.

00:08:32.245 --> 00:08:33.269
I'm sorry.

00:08:33.546 --> 00:08:36.015
Let's go to Wizard Kingdom.

00:08:36.148 --> 00:08:39.345
Yeah, let's go to the place
where our children are.

00:09:11.284 --> 00:09:15.778
These are the remains at the bottom
of Hydra Lake. We can hide here.

00:09:40.513 --> 00:09:41.446
This way!

00:09:41.948 --> 00:09:43.438
What's going on?

00:09:43.549 --> 00:09:46.314
| don't want destruction to come!
I don't want to die!

00:09:46.419 --> 00:09:47.682
I'm scared!

00:09:47.787 --> 00:09:50.449
The destruction has reached
this area already!

00:10:38.371 --> 00:10:39.065
Sheila!

00:10:39.171 --> 00:10:39.681
Eva!

00:10:39.705 --> 00:10:40.763
Eva!
Lennon!

00:10:40.873 --> 00:10:41.601
Arusu!

00:10:59.659 --> 00:11:03.357
Oh no! It's bad! It's bad! It's bad!

00:11:04.130 --> 00:11:05.063
Dad!

00:11:09.468 --> 00:11:10.731
Sigma!

00:11:11.303 --> 00:11:13.601
| can't let you die!

00:11:13.806 --> 00:11:14.602
What?

00:11:14.774 --> 00:11:18.608
It's true this time.
I've been waiting for you all this time.

00:11:19.145 --> 00:11:22.206
Waiting for a savior to save this realm.

00:11:23.449 --> 00:11:24.610
Savior?

00:11:32.658 --> 00:11:35.650
Tweeny Witches

00:11:40.199 --> 00:11:44.659
Escape

00:11:47.273 --> 00:11:49.435
My father predicted the future.

00:11:49.542 --> 00:11:53.103
He said a savior will appear
and save this realm.

00:11:53.479 --> 00:11:54.412
| see...

00:11:54.513 --> 00:11:56.072
And that's me?

00:11:56.182 --> 00:11:59.345
You're a human, but you can use magic.

00:11:59.452 --> 00:12:00.681
Savior?

00:12:00.853 --> 00:12:04.756
You said that magic is supposed
to make other people happy.

00:12:05.057 --> 00:12:08.459
There's nobody like that
in this realm. That's why I...

00:12:08.694 --> 00:12:09.771
The magic of light!

00:12:09.795 --> 00:12:10.956
The magic of light!
The magic of light?

00:12:11.063 --> 00:12:15.057
Didn't your father say
anything about light magic?

00:12:15.434 --> 00:12:17.198
No, I've never heard of it.

00:12:17.937 --> 00:12:19.427
Atelia told me...

00:12:19.538 --> 00:12:23.702
When the savior created this realm
long ago, light magic was used.

00:12:23.809 --> 00:12:26.210
That's what it said in
the Book of Prophecies.

00:12:28.380 --> 00:12:29.211
Listen!

00:12:29.448 --> 00:12:34.215
I think light magic is the only thing
that can destroy dark magic.

00:12:34.553 --> 00:12:37.250
If you like, we can go
ask your father and...

00:12:37.723 --> 00:12:38.485
Sorry.

00:12:40.226 --> 00:12:42.160
My father was killed by Grande.

00:12:42.561 --> 00:12:47.397
That's why I want to prove that
my father's predictions were right.

00:12:47.767 --> 00:12:50.099
I kind of understand
how you feel, and...

00:12:50.236 --> 00:12:52.136
...| also want to help everyone.

00:12:52.238 --> 00:12:53.831
But I'm not really...

00:12:53.939 --> 00:12:54.497
Hurry!

00:12:54.607 --> 00:12:56.097
| can't be the savior!

00:12:58.410 --> 00:12:59.400
Find them!

00:12:59.512 --> 00:13:03.312
I'm sure they're still alive!
They must be around here somewhere!

00:13:08.854 --> 00:13:11.824
Magic is not important
because of tradition.

00:13:11.924 --> 00:13:16.225
But because it can make other
people happy. Magic is important.

00:13:16.796 --> 00:13:18.560
That's what she taught me.

00:13:18.664 --> 00:13:19.358
Arusu?

00:13:20.299 --> 00:13:23.428
Maybe she is the savior after all.

00:13:24.303 --> 00:13:28.240
The only one who can use
the legendary light magic...

00:13:31.410 --> 00:13:32.138
What?

00:13:32.244 --> 00:13:33.905
What about Grande?

00:13:34.680 --> 00:13:36.614
What's wrong, Luca?

00:13:37.583 --> 00:13:40.848
The Warlock Realm... Wizard Kingdom...

00:13:41.053 --> 00:13:43.147
...is being destroyed.

00:13:43.222 --> 00:13:44.121
What?

00:13:47.693 --> 00:13:50.890
Leave this place to me.
Get the fairies out of here!

00:13:50.996 --> 00:13:53.192
| can't use my magic anymore!

00:13:53.265 --> 00:13:54.664
It's impossible!

00:13:54.767 --> 00:13:58.397
Even if you think it's impossible, you
have to hang in there or else it's over!

00:13:58.537 --> 00:14:00.869
They're going to use dark magic!

00:14:01.340 --> 00:14:03.035
He's on the other side of that door.

00:14:03.108 --> 00:14:05.975
If we kill Grande,
everything will be over!

00:14:11.383 --> 00:14:14.284
This is all I need.

00:14:17.256 --> 00:14:19.918
This is bad! The holding cell is moving!

00:14:21.994 --> 00:14:25.658
They're trying to connect
something to the command center!

00:14:25.931 --> 00:14:27.365
We won't let you!

00:14:31.203 --> 00:14:31.761
Wil!

00:14:32.538 --> 00:14:36.304
If you don't hurry, this place will
be sucked up by the destruction!

00:14:36.408 --> 00:14:37.876
Hurry up and get out!

00:14:37.977 --> 00:14:40.275
Wait a minute! We have fairies in here!

00:14:41.580 --> 00:14:43.947
Fine. We'll protect the fairies.

00:14:44.083 --> 00:14:46.780
Can you help evacuate the citizens?

00:14:47.820 --> 00:14:48.446
Got it!

00:14:48.888 --> 00:14:49.878
Let's go, Eva!

00:14:49.955 --> 00:14:50.547
Okay!

00:14:51.323 --> 00:14:54.190
We have about an hour
till this place is destroyed.

00:14:54.460 --> 00:14:57.157
Escape before time's up. Got it?

00:14:58.030 --> 00:15:01.523
This is the best opportunity for
us wizards to show what we can do!

00:15:01.634 --> 00:15:04.604
We'll defeat Grande
and release the fairies!

00:15:04.703 --> 00:15:05.761
Yeah!

00:15:09.241 --> 00:15:10.800
What's going on?

00:15:10.910 --> 00:15:12.810
What am I supposed to do?

00:15:15.314 --> 00:15:18.375
Hey! What happened to your mom and dad?

00:15:26.292 --> 00:15:28.556
They will never stop chasing me.

00:15:28.928 --> 00:15:31.226
They need the True Book of Spells...

00:15:32.331 --> 00:15:34.163
Arusu made a promise.

00:15:34.300 --> 00:15:37.395
She said she'd exchange the
True Book of Spells for your life.

00:15:37.469 --> 00:15:39.130
And she'll return.

00:15:39.271 --> 00:15:41.933
Then my life will be spared.

00:15:43.142 --> 00:15:44.439
Arusu...

00:15:50.115 --> 00:15:51.048
Are you okay?

00:15:51.116 --> 00:15:51.947
Somewhat...

00:15:53.152 --> 00:15:53.778
Hey!

00:15:53.886 --> 00:15:56.048
There are fairies down here!

00:15:57.256 --> 00:15:58.121
Arusu!

00:16:02.995 --> 00:16:04.554
A-Arusu...

00:16:07.433 --> 00:16:08.264
Luca?

00:16:09.601 --> 00:16:13.560
We're going to carry out our orders!
Find Jidan and Atelia!

00:16:15.407 --> 00:16:17.876
This way, everyone!
Go outside from this exit!

00:16:17.977 --> 00:16:20.469
Sheila, we don't have much time!

00:16:23.983 --> 00:16:27.180
Everyone! We're getting
out of here in this thing!

00:16:28.053 --> 00:16:31.216
| remember now!
Lennon used to be a buccaneer!

00:16:38.998 --> 00:16:42.992
This lake is connected to Hydra Lake.
You won't get caught.

00:16:43.135 --> 00:16:44.034
Jidan?

00:16:46.405 --> 00:16:47.998
| want you to tell Arusu...

00:16:48.107 --> 00:16:51.133
...that even if she shines light into
darkness, it'll just be sucked up.

00:16:51.243 --> 00:16:53.405
Try to harness the light from within.

00:16:53.512 --> 00:16:56.914
That's what I feel is light magic.

00:17:10.829 --> 00:17:12.763
There he is! It's Jidan!

00:17:21.974 --> 00:17:23.874
Because of you people...

00:17:23.976 --> 00:17:24.534
Fire!

00:17:37.389 --> 00:17:39.949
It's gone! The command center is gone!

00:17:42.428 --> 00:17:46.194
I'm guessing that Grande and the others
disappeared with the destruction.

00:17:46.365 --> 00:17:48.925
Evacuate! We will join
Sheila and the others!

00:17:49.034 --> 00:17:49.830
Okay!

00:17:53.539 --> 00:17:54.563
Sigma!

00:17:55.407 --> 00:17:57.205
Hey, where's Arusu?

00:17:57.309 --> 00:17:58.299
Arusu?

00:18:00.012 --> 00:18:03.573
| thought she already
escaped with the fairies.

00:18:03.982 --> 00:18:05.643
Arusu is still inside.

00:18:05.751 --> 00:18:08.152
She's left behind
with the other fairies!

00:18:10.622 --> 00:18:13.182
Let's go! We have to
evacuate for the time being!

00:18:28.307 --> 00:18:29.399
Arusu!

00:18:29.908 --> 00:18:30.875
Arusu...

00:18:31.176 --> 00:18:32.405
No!

00:18:32.511 --> 00:18:33.410
It can't be.

00:18:35.914 --> 00:18:37.382
Sheila, look!

00:18:38.984 --> 00:18:39.883
The fairies!

00:18:39.952 --> 00:18:41.511
No, I meant that!

00:18:44.923 --> 00:18:46.254
Hey!

00:18:47.593 --> 00:18:48.069
Arusu!

00:18:48.093 --> 00:18:50.084
Arusu!
Even though Grande is gone...

00:18:50.662 --> 00:18:54.656
...our Miche Village will be
destroyed soon. Then Witch Heaven...

00:18:55.334 --> 00:18:57.302
We can't stop the destruction.

00:19:17.122 --> 00:19:18.317
Dad!

00:19:19.525 --> 00:19:21.892
Good thing you're alive.

00:19:22.961 --> 00:19:26.124
You know what? Those people helped me.

00:19:26.798 --> 00:19:29.096
You! What is the meaning of this?

00:19:29.201 --> 00:19:31.226
Well, I made a promise, didn't I?

00:19:31.336 --> 00:19:34.670
| said I'd hand over the True Book
of Spells and come back here.

00:19:34.773 --> 00:19:38.403
Promise? Your father escaped
of his own will and...

00:19:38.577 --> 00:19:41.911
So why did you hand over the
True Book of Spells to Grande?

00:19:42.381 --> 00:19:46.340
Well, I think I'm naively honest, but...

00:19:46.451 --> 00:19:51.082
I'm the only human in this realm, so
I thought I had to set a good example.

00:19:51.356 --> 00:19:52.881
Oh yeah, my dad's here too.

00:19:52.958 --> 00:19:53.948
I'm sorry.

00:19:54.092 --> 00:19:54.752
What?

00:19:55.827 --> 00:19:57.056
But I...

00:19:57.529 --> 00:19:58.792
Jidan was...

00:20:00.832 --> 00:20:01.765
Atelia!

00:20:01.867 --> 00:20:02.425
Mother!

00:20:02.634 --> 00:20:04.159
Hey, where's my dad?

00:20:04.937 --> 00:20:05.665
Hey!

00:20:06.104 --> 00:20:08.732
Where's my dad?

00:20:17.082 --> 00:20:25.046
Come on, let's go!
Without closing our eyes...

00:20:25.224 --> 00:20:33.224
Our singing and laughter
fill the vast sky.

00:20:34.466 --> 00:20:42.466
We're headed for
our greatest longings.

00:20:43.675 --> 00:20:49.239
There's no wish
that can't come true.

00:20:49.348 --> 00:20:53.615
Let's just believe and fly away!

00:20:54.353 --> 00:20:58.586
No matter how hopeless it seems...
If we wish hard enough...

00:20:58.690 --> 00:21:03.287
See, it'll turn info magic.

00:21:03.495 --> 00:21:08.661
Even the tiniest dream...
If it can bring somebody joy...

00:21:08.767 --> 00:21:11.828
Let's hope it does.

00:21:13.405 --> 00:21:17.899
Hey! DuDiDuWa...
We're laughing always, lalala...

00:21:18.010 --> 00:21:20.502
Let's sing your song and
smile and laugh with me.

00:21:20.612 --> 00:21:28.612
The truth is we're all waiting...

00:21:29.821 --> 00:21:35.521
...for the world of our dreams.

00:21:35.627 --> 00:21:39.825
So we might as well
Just make one of our own!
